upcie-experimental (0.8.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship dmabuf_import and iommu_map_pa in one binary package, since the
    experimental paths need both; supersedes dmabuf-import-dkms (0.2.0) and
    iommu-map-pa-dkms (0.2.0), which are conflicted, replaced and provided.
  * Track the upcie version rather than versioning the modules separately, so
    the deb, the DKMS tree, MODULE_VERSION and the upcie headers all agree.

